00:58:21.390 --> 00:58:26.250
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who has just one question for you.
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia）负责，他只有一个问题要问你。

00:58:26.250 --> 00:58:29.580
<v Matt Malloy>Hey baby, wanna play nanny goat and ride in the back?
<v Matt Malloy>嘿宝贝，想玩山羊游戏，坐到后面来吗？

00:58:29.580 --> 00:58:55.330
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

00:58:55.330 --> 00:59:00.330
